SUMMARY:Food and Wine Pairing Dinner at Grindstone Wines
DESCRIPTION:An evening of elevated pairings\, handcrafted wines\, and unforgettable flavors. \nJoin us for a four-course farm-to-table dinner on Thursday October 1st at 6:00pm\, expertly prepared on-site by Chef Raphael Reyes\, co-founder of Heddon & Greta Hospitality. With more than 30 years of culinary experience spanning luxury hotels\, acclaimed restaurants\, private dining\, and large-scale hospitality\, Chef Raphael brings refined technique and a passion for locally inspired cuisine to every course. \nEach thoughtfully curated dish will be paired with a Grindstone wine\, including an exclusive first taste of a new vintage available only to dinner guests before heading back to the cellar for it’s future release. \nGather around the table with fellow wine lovers for an evening that celebrates exceptional food\, handcrafted wine\, and genuine hospitality. \nPairing Dinner Tickets: $105
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/food-and-wine-pairing-dinner-at-grindstone-wines/
LOCATION:Grindstone Wines\, 12700 County Road 89\, Esparto\, CA\, 95627\, United States
