SUMMARY:Nacho and the Dollar Menu Live @ The Melon Ball
DESCRIPTION:Live music at The Melon Ball in Davis. \nNacho and the Dollar Menu was originally formed by Thomas Ignacio Molina in 2014. The mission of Nacho and The Dollar Menu is to help keep Northern Californian Latino music alive and well.  The band plays a mix of original music\, classic covers and new music reimagined through the lens of Latino musical styles.  Heavily influenced by the bands from the Mission in San Francisco and especially fond of cumbia and Chicano oldies\, the band functions as a creative outlet for its members and a cultural preservation organization. \nWhether you’re in dancing shoes or you just want to enjoy some classic NorCal vibes\, Nacho and the Dollar Menu has something for you. \nInstagram\nLittle Sunflower (Video Clip)\nDidn’t Cha Know (Video Clip) \n$20 General Admission\nThis is BYOB event\n7:30 Doors\n8:00 Show
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/nacho-and-the-dollar-menu-live-the-melon-ball/
LOCATION:The Melon Ball – Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Nacho2-1.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Watermelon Music":MAILTO:info@watermelonmusic.com
END:VEVENT
